    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "Yes, it's certainly possible that a matrix that is almost PSD might act differently on different GPUs, or even perhaps nondeterministically on the same GPU due to concurrency changing order of operations. I'm still a bit surprised that it's nondeterministic.",
