  {
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "This should be fixed with `XLA_FLAGS---xla_gpu_deterministic_ops=true`.\r\n\r\n(It turned out `=1` wasn't accepted by XLA, but that is now also fixed for the next jaxlib release.)",
